+---
+title: Weather and warnings in Portugal
+summary: IPMA's weather warnings, today's sea state and the fire-risk count, on a page that is free to read. IPMA is the source; nothing here is charged for.
+free: true
+---
+**This page is free: no fee is charged for it.** The reading meter does not run here. IPMA, Portugal's weather and sea institute, allows its data to be used where no profit is made, so it is shown on a page with no charge and nowhere else on promptugal.news. Source: [IPMA](https://www.ipma.pt/en/), read through [data.promptugal.news](https://data.promptugal.news/). This is not a warning service: follow IPMA and ANEPC for what to do.
+
+<!-- weather:status -->
+
+## Warnings now {#warnings}
+
+<!-- weather:warnings -->
+
+## The sea today {#sea}
+
+<!-- weather:sea -->
+
+## Fire risk today {#fire}
+
+<!-- weather:fire -->
+
+## Also
+
+- Each town's page links here from its "Now in" block, and to the weather site for the forecast.
+- [The data behind this page](https://data.promptugal.news/sources/ipma-warnings/), free and non-commercial.
